    "executive_summary": "Audited 919 point-in-time signals on XAU/USD. Zero lookahead violations confirmed. BUY (N=599, WR=45.4%, Exp=+0.14R) vs SELL (N=319, WR=43.3%, Exp=+0.08R). Strength Calibration Brier Score: 0.2527, ECE: 5.24%."
